    {
      "displayText": "Then I’ll need three Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFirst, we must have a Ground-type Pokémon.\nNext, a Pokémon that knows Flamethrower.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFinally, a Pokémon bearing a Mega Stone!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
