      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In that case, I’ll need to see four Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFirst, we’ll need a Fairy-type Pokémon.\nSecond, a Dragon-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe third Pokémon should be an alpha Pokémon.\nAnd the fourth should be...another alpha.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
