      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then help me assemble our perfect cast of\ncharacters!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFirst, I think we’ll need an alpha Pokémon.\nSecond, a Normal-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe third should be a Dark-type Pokémon.\nThe fourth should know the move Teleport.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd the fifth must be a Fighting-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
